  storyText: "UNIVERSITY TRANSCRIPT: MAJOR\r\n    \r\n        \"Before the sirens, you were preparing for a career. What was your focus?\""
  narrativeBeats:
  - "ROTC\r\n            Military science. You spent weekends at the range."
  - "SPORTS\r\n            Varsity combat sports. How to use your body as a weapon."
  - "TRACK\r\n            Outdoor survival. Move through terrain without being noticed."
  - "CS & IT\r\n            Hardware engineering. Manipulate electronics and security."
  - "BIOLOGY\r\n            Pre-med sciences. You understand anatomy and how to patch wounds."
